hassio_confirm.description:
{app_name} announced itself to Home Assistant, so the connection details are already filled in.

Engine URL: {url}
CT channels reported: {channel_count}

Nothing is written to the engine until you confirm the connection. If the engine is not reachable, the usual connection error is shown and you can retry.

endpoints.description:
Discovered endpoints: {endpoint_count}.

{endpoint_rows}

For a CT you may name a parent circuit; an inferred parent is shown as a suggestion and is written only when you leave it accepted. For a plug that measures exactly one appliance, name the device it measures. Devices are created automatically.

